      "value": "Thank you for your feedback! \n\nThe current release (2023.1.1) is slightly too loud at low volume levels. The issue will be fixed in our next release.\n\nIn the meantime, you can turn off 'slider snapping' in VRChat's options. This will let you lower your volume as low as 1%, which may be more comfortable for you.",
